%%% note
logger: 既定のログ設定 (アプリに log4j2.xml が無いとき) でどのレベルが出るか (TRACE/DEBUG は
出ない)、category、message の式 (文字列、Object、Array、JSON 出力、埋め込み式、null)、message
を省いたとき、式が失敗したとき、ハンドラ無しのエラーで既定のハンドラが出すログ
(log=* で全カテゴリを記録)。記録形式は "<LEVEL> <category>: <message>"。
%%% port 18124
%%% mask
event: ([0-9a-f-]{36})
correlationId=([0-9a-f-]{36})
id=([0-9a-f-]{36})
ManagedCursorStreamProvider@([0-9a-f]+)
Remote Address=/127\.0\.0\.1:(\d+)
%%% request GET /levels log
%%% response 200

logged
%%% log
INFO org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: info message
WARN org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: warn message
ERROR org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: error message
%%% request GET /category log=*
%%% response 200

logged
%%% log
WARN com.example.audit: audit warning
%%% request POST /expressions log
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ann", "items": [1, 2, 3]}
%%% response 200

logged
%%% log
INFO org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: {"name": "Ann", "items": [1, 2, 3]}
INFO org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: "name=Ann"
INFO org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: [
  1,
  2,
  3
]
INFO org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: {"name": "Ann","items": [1,2,3]}
INFO org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: Embedded "Ann" and 3 items
INFO org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: null
INFO org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: null
%%% request POST /no-message log
Content-Type: text/plain

body text
%%% response 200

logged
%%% log
INFO org.mule.runtime.core.internal.processor.LoggerMessageProcessor: 
org.mule.runtime.core.internal.message.DefaultMessageBuilder$MessageImplementation
{
  payload=org.mule.runtime.core.internal.streaming.bytes.ManagedCursorStreamProvider@***
  mediaType=text/plain; charset=UTF-8
  attributes=org.mule.extension.http.api.HttpRequestAttributes
{
   Request path=/no-message
   Raw request path=/no-message
   Method=POST
   Listener path=/no-message
   Local Address=/127.0.0.1:18124
   Query String=
   Relative Path=/no-message
   Masked Request Path=null
   Remote Address=/127.0.0.1:***
   Request Uri=/no-message
   Raw request Uri=/no-message
   Scheme=http
   Version=HTTP/1.1
   Headers=[
      host=localhost:18124
      content-type=text/plain
      content-length=9
   ]
   Query Parameters=[]
   URI Parameters=[]
}
  attributesMediaType=*/*
}
%%% request GET /bad-expression log=*
%%% response 500
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

"Division by zero

1| 1 / 0
   ^^^^^
Trace:
  at main (line: 1, column: 1)" evaluating expression: "1 / 0".
%%% log
ERROR org.mule.runtime.core.privileged.exception.DefaultExceptionListener: 
********************************************************************************
Message               : "Division by zero

1| 1 / 0
   ^^^^^
Trace:
  at main (line: 1, column: 1)" evaluating expression: "1 / 0".
Element               : bad-expression/processors/0 @ core-logger:core-logger.xml:56
Element DSL           : <logger level="INFO" message="#[1 / 0]"></logger>
Error type            : MULE:EXPRESSION
FlowStack             : at bad-expression(bad-expression/processors/0 @ core-logger:core-logger.xml:56)

  (set debug level logging or '-Dmule.verbose.exceptions=true' for everything)
********************************************************************************
